# Boost on 38's end save (run.py hgss_boost: np_save4 set-move on a member already in the party).
# The Tower's picks: 0 TYPHLOSION, 3 AMPHAROS, 5 FERALIGATR. The first draft lost its third battle to a Chinchou
# (Water/Electric, Volt Absorb): AMPHAROS's Thunderbolt and Discharge did nothing, Focus Blast missed, FERALIGATR's
# Dragon Pulse was all it had left. Earthquake (super effective on it, and on the Tower's Electric and Fire types)
# goes on TYPHLOSION over its spent Earthquake slot (PP restored) and on FERALIGATR over Strength.
party-move 0 1 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 5 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
